      "audioScript": "Nam: Hi Mai! Have you finished preparing your presentation about A Peaceful Coastal Neighbourhood in Da Nang?\nMai: Hi Nam! Yes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about Da Nang and its My Khe beach.\nNam: What is the most memorable feature there?\nMai: Visitors are truly amazed by the fresh breeze and love badminton.\nNam: Did you also mention bakery in your talk?\nMai: Absolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nNam: Excellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about a peaceful coastal neighbourhood in da nang offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Da Nang, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in badminton helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "A Peaceful Coastal Neighbourhood in Da Nang represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Da Nang. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience My Khe beach and fresh breeze. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in badminton, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect bakery. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about a peaceful coastal neighbourhood in da nang offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Da Nang, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in badminton helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nA Peaceful Coastal Neighbourhood in Da Nang represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Da Nang. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience My Khe beach and fresh breeze. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in badminton, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect bakery. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
