          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (50-60 words) about Exploring Sung Sot Cave in Ha Long Bay.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Location in Ha Long Bay; Key features like Sung Sot Cave; What you can do there; Why it is special to you.",
