      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_6_ck1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Nam: Hi Mai! Have you finished preparing your presentation about Adventures in Trang An Grottoes?\nMai: Hi Nam! Yes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about Trang An and its limestone peaks.\nNam: What is the most memorable feature there?\nMai: Visitors are truly amazed by the crystal river and love boat trip.\nNam: Did you also mention ancient temple in your talk?\nMai: Absolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nNam: Excellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about adventures in trang an grottoes offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Trang An, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in boat trip helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "Adventures in Trang An Grottoes represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Trang An. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience limestone peaks and crystal river. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in boat trip, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect ancient temple. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about adventures in trang an grottoes offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Trang An, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in boat trip helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nAdventures in Trang An Grottoes represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Trang An. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience limestone peaks and crystal river. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in boat trip, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect ancient temple. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Location in Trang An; Key features like limestone peaks; What you can do there; Why it is special to you.",
      "sampleWritingText": "Adventures in Trang An Grottoes in Trang An is one of my most cherished experiences. The atmosphere is peaceful, surrounded by limestone peaks and refreshing crystal river. During my visit, I enjoyed boat trip and meeting hospitable local residents. Furthermore, learning about ancient temple deepened my appreciation for Vietnamese culture. I hope everyone will join hands to preserve this wonderful destination.",
