      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_6_ck1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Phong: Hi Lan! Have you finished preparing your presentation about Decorating the Living Room for New Year?\nLan: Hi Phong! Yes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about living room and its apricot blossom.\nPhong: What is the most memorable feature there?\nLan: Visitors are truly amazed by the lucky money and love cleaning furniture.\nPhong: Did you also mention greeting elders in your talk?\nLan: Absolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nPhong: Excellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about decorating the living room for new year offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In living room, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in cleaning furniture helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "Decorating the Living Room for New Year represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with living room. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience apricot blossom and lucky money. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in cleaning furniture, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect greeting elders. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about decorating the living room for new year offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In living room, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in cleaning furniture helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nDecorating the Living Room for New Year represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with living room. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience apricot blossom and lucky money. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in cleaning furniture, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect greeting elders. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Location in living room; Key features like apricot blossom; What you can do there; Why it is special to you.",
      "sampleWritingText": "Decorating the Living Room for New Year in living room is one of my most cherished experiences. The atmosphere is peaceful, surrounded by apricot blossom and refreshing lucky money. During my visit, I enjoyed cleaning furniture and meeting hospitable local residents. Furthermore, learning about greeting elders deepened my appreciation for Vietnamese culture. I hope everyone will join hands to preserve this wonderful destination.",
