      "audioScript": "Nam: Hi Mai! Have you finished preparing your presentation about Spring Flower Market in Sa Dec?\nMai: Hi Nam! Yes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about Sa Dec and its flower village.\nNam: What is the most memorable feature there?\nMai: Visitors are truly amazed by the colourful chrysanthemums and love taking photos.\nNam: Did you also mention river boats in your talk?\nMai: Absolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nNam: Excellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about spring flower market in sa dec offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Sa Dec, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in taking photos helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "Spring Flower Market in Sa Dec represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Sa Dec. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience flower village and colourful chrysanthemums. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in taking photos, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect river boats. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about spring flower market in sa dec offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Sa Dec, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in taking photos helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSpring Flower Market in Sa Dec represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Sa Dec. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience flower village and colourful chrysanthemums. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in taking photos, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect river boats. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Location in Sa Dec; Key features like flower village; What you can do there; Why it is special to you.",
      "sampleWritingText": "Spring Flower Market in Sa Dec in Sa Dec is one of my most cherished experiences. The atmosphere is peaceful, surrounded by flower village and refreshing colourful chrysanthemums. During my visit, I enjoyed taking photos and meeting hospitable local residents. Furthermore, learning about river boats deepened my appreciation for Vietnamese culture. I hope everyone will join hands to preserve this wonderful destination.",
