      "audioScript": "Nam: Hi Mai! Have you finished preparing your presentation about Majestic Ban Gioc Waterfall in Cao Bang?\nMai: Hi Nam! Yes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about Ban Gioc and its cascading waters.\nNam: What is the most memorable feature there?\nMai: Visitors are truly amazed by the bamboo raft and love river border.\nNam: Did you also mention wild nature in your talk?\nMai: Absolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nNam: Excellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about majestic ban gioc waterfall in cao bang offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Ban Gioc, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in river border helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "Majestic Ban Gioc Waterfall in Cao Bang represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Ban Gioc. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience cascading waters and bamboo raft. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in river border, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect wild nature. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about majestic ban gioc waterfall in cao bang offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Ban Gioc, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in river border helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nMajestic Ban Gioc Waterfall in Cao Bang represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Ban Gioc. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience cascading waters and bamboo raft. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in river border, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect wild nature. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
