      "audioScript": "Phong: Hi Lan! Have you finished preparing your presentation about Tet Family Reunion and Traditional Wishes?\nLan: Hi Phong! Yes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about hometown and its grandparents house.\nPhong: What is the most memorable feature there?\nLan: Visitors are truly amazed by the warm hearth and love wishing health.\nPhong: Did you also mention reunion feast in your talk?\nLan: Absolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nPhong: Excellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about tet family reunion and traditional wishes offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In hometown, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in wishing health helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "Tet Family Reunion and Traditional Wishes represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with hometown. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience grandparents house and warm hearth. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in wishing health, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect reunion feast. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about tet family reunion and traditional wishes offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In hometown, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in wishing health helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nTet Family Reunion and Traditional Wishes represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with hometown. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience grandparents house and warm hearth. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in wishing health, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect reunion feast. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Location in hometown; Key features like grandparents house; What you can do there; Why it is special to you.",
      "sampleWritingText": "Tet Family Reunion and Traditional Wishes in hometown is one of my most cherished experiences. The atmosphere is peaceful, surrounded by grandparents house and refreshing warm hearth. During my visit, I enjoyed wishing health and meeting hospitable local residents. Furthermore, learning about reunion feast deepened my appreciation for Vietnamese culture. I hope everyone will join hands to preserve this wonderful destination.",
