      "audioScript": "Nam: Hi Mai! Have you finished preparing your presentation about Cat Ba Biosphere Reserve and Golden Monkeys?\nMai: Hi Nam! Yes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about Cat Ba Island and its coastal reserve.\nNam: What is the most memorable feature there?\nMai: Visitors are truly amazed by the hiking paths and love rare langurs.\nNam: Did you also mention biodiversity in your talk?\nMai: Absolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nNam: Excellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about cat ba biosphere reserve and golden monkeys offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Cat Ba Island, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in rare langurs helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "Cat Ba Biosphere Reserve and Golden Monkeys represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Cat Ba Island. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience coastal reserve and hiking paths. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in rare langurs, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect biodiversity. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about cat ba biosphere reserve and golden monkeys offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Cat Ba Island, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in rare langurs helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nCat Ba Biosphere Reserve and Golden Monkeys represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Cat Ba Island. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience coastal reserve and hiking paths. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in rare langurs, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect biodiversity. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Location in Cat Ba Island; Key features like coastal reserve; What you can do there; Why it is special to you.",
      "sampleWritingText": "Cat Ba Biosphere Reserve and Golden Monkeys in Cat Ba Island is one of my most cherished experiences. The atmosphere is peaceful, surrounded by coastal reserve and refreshing hiking paths. During my visit, I enjoyed rare langurs and meeting hospitable local residents. Furthermore, learning about biodiversity deepened my appreciation for Vietnamese culture. I hope everyone will join hands to preserve this wonderful destination.",
