      "audioScript": "Phong: Hi Lan! Have you finished preparing your presentation about New Year Eve Fireworks Over Hoan Kiem Lake?\nLan: Hi Phong! Yes, I have gathered lots of interesting facts about Hoan Kiem Lake and its Turtle Tower.\nPhong: What is the most memorable feature there?\nLan: Visitors are truly amazed by the sparkling fireworks and love crowd cheering.\nPhong: Did you also mention midnight bell in your talk?\nLan: Absolutely! That is one of the most distinctive highlights of the entire experience.\nPhong: Excellent! I am confident the class will learn a lot from your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Learning about new year eve fireworks over hoan kiem lake offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Hoan Kiem Lake, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in crowd cheering helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.",
      "readingText": "New Year Eve Fireworks Over Hoan Kiem Lake represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Hoan Kiem Lake. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience Turtle Tower and sparkling fireworks. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in crowd cheering, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect midnight bell. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nLearning about new year eve fireworks over hoan kiem lake offers secondary school students meaningful insights into our culture and environment. In Hoan Kiem Lake, local people take great pride in preserving their natural surroundings and (23) ________. Every morning, residents and visitors can breathe the pure (24) ________ while admiring the beautiful landscape. To keep this destination attractive, all tourists (25) ________ follow local rules and avoid littering. Furthermore, spending time participating in crowd cheering helps young people develop valuable life (26) ________. In summary, visiting this destination leaves an unforgettable (27) ________ in everyone's memory.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nNew Year Eve Fireworks Over Hoan Kiem Lake represents one of the most beloved cultural and geographical highlights associated with Hoan Kiem Lake. Covering a picturesque territory, this destination welcomes thousands of visitors who come to experience Turtle Tower and sparkling fireworks. During festive seasons or sunny weekends, families gather to take part in crowd cheering, creating a warm and vibrant atmosphere. Local authorities and community volunteers work tirelessly to maintain public cleanliness, install solar lighting, and protect midnight bell. Moreover, friendly local residents always greet newcomers with sincere hospitality, offering helpful directions and traditional specialities. Preserving these cherished values ensures that younger generations continue to appreciate the cultural heritage and natural wonders of our homeland.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Location in Hoan Kiem Lake; Key features like Turtle Tower; What you can do there; Why it is special to you.",
