          "text": "Write a paragraph (50-60 words) about New Year Eve Fireworks Over Hoan Kiem Lake.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Location in Hoan Kiem Lake; Key features like Turtle Tower; What you can do there; Why it is special to you.",
