      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_7_ck1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Nam: Hi Mai! What cultural heritage or culinary topic are you reviewing for English class?\nMai: Hi Nam! I am presenting about A Historical Tour of Van Mieu - Quoc Tu Giam at Temple of Literature.\nNam: What is the most remarkable aspect of this tradition?\nMai: Everyone appreciates Doctor stone stelae and enjoys admiring ancient scholars.\nNam: How does it reflect the cultural identity of our people?\nMai: It highlights ancient Khue Van Cac and showcases the authentic value of Imperial Academy gate.\nNam: That is wonderful! You will definitely achieve a high grade for your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Vietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying a historical tour of van mieu - quoc tu giam, students discover how Temple of Literature preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering admiring ancient scholars requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire Doctor stone stelae, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "A Historical Tour of Van Mieu - Quoc Tu Giam represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Temple of Literature. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined Doctor stone stelae and ancient Khue Van Cac, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in admiring ancient scholars, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard Imperial Academy gate to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nVietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying a historical tour of van mieu - quoc tu giam, students discover how Temple of Literature preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering admiring ancient scholars requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire Doctor stone stelae, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nA Historical Tour of Van Mieu - Quoc Tu Giam represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Temple of Literature. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined Doctor stone stelae and ancient Khue Van Cac, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in admiring ancient scholars, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard Imperial Academy gate to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Location in Temple of Literature; Key ingredients or artistic features; How it is practiced; Why it is meaningful.",
      "sampleWritingText": "A Historical Tour of Van Mieu - Quoc Tu Giam at Temple of Literature is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases Doctor stone stelae and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in admiring ancient scholars, visitors discover how ancient Khue Van Cac has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding Imperial Academy gate helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
