      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_7_ck1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Nam: Hi Mai! What cultural heritage or culinary topic are you reviewing for English class?\nMai: Hi Nam! I am presenting about The Rich Flavours of Bun Bo Hue at Hue imperial city.\nNam: What is the most remarkable aspect of this tradition?\nMai: Everyone appreciates lemongrass spicy broth and enjoys tasting imperial dishes.\nNam: How does it reflect the cultural identity of our people?\nMai: It highlights round rice noodles and showcases the authentic value of banana flower salad.\nNam: That is wonderful! You will definitely achieve a high grade for your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Vietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying the rich flavours of bun bo hue, students discover how Hue imperial city preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering tasting imperial dishes requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire lemongrass spicy broth, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "The Rich Flavours of Bun Bo Hue represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Hue imperial city. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined lemongrass spicy broth and round rice noodles, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in tasting imperial dishes, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard banana flower salad to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nVietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying the rich flavours of bun bo hue, students discover how Hue imperial city preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering tasting imperial dishes requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire lemongrass spicy broth, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe Rich Flavours of Bun Bo Hue represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Hue imperial city. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined lemongrass spicy broth and round rice noodles, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in tasting imperial dishes, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard banana flower salad to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Location in Hue imperial city; Key ingredients or artistic features; How it is practiced; Why it is meaningful.",
      "sampleWritingText": "The Rich Flavours of Bun Bo Hue at Hue imperial city is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases lemongrass spicy broth and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in tasting imperial dishes, visitors discover how round rice noodles has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding banana flower salad helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
