          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) describing The Rich Flavours of Bun Bo Hue.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Location in Hue imperial city; Key ingredients or artistic features; How it is practiced; Why it is meaningful.",
          "options": [],
