      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_7_ck1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Nam: Hi Mai! What cultural heritage or culinary topic are you reviewing for English class?\nMai: Hi Nam! I am presenting about The Melodic Beauty of Quan Ho Folk Singing at Bac Ninh festival.\nNam: What is the most remarkable aspect of this tradition?\nMai: Everyone appreciates duet folk songs and enjoys listening to singers.\nNam: How does it reflect the cultural identity of our people?\nMai: It highlights conical palm hats (non quai thao) and showcases the authentic value of traditional silk costume.\nNam: That is wonderful! You will definitely achieve a high grade for your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Vietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying the melodic beauty of quan ho folk singing, students discover how Bac Ninh festival preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering listening to singers requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire duet folk songs, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "The Melodic Beauty of Quan Ho Folk Singing represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Bac Ninh festival. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined duet folk songs and conical palm hats (non quai thao), creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in listening to singers, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard traditional silk costume to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nVietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying the melodic beauty of quan ho folk singing, students discover how Bac Ninh festival preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering listening to singers requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire duet folk songs, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe Melodic Beauty of Quan Ho Folk Singing represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Bac Ninh festival. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined duet folk songs and conical palm hats (non quai thao), creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in listening to singers, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard traditional silk costume to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Location in Bac Ninh festival; Key ingredients or artistic features; How it is practiced; Why it is meaningful.",
      "sampleWritingText": "The Melodic Beauty of Quan Ho Folk Singing at Bac Ninh festival is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases duet folk songs and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in listening to singers, visitors discover how conical palm hats (non quai thao) has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding traditional silk costume helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
