      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_7_ck1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Nam: Hi Mai! What cultural heritage or culinary topic are you reviewing for English class?\nMai: Hi Nam! I am presenting about The Imperial Examination Halls of Ancient Dai Viet at National Museum.\nNam: What is the most remarkable aspect of this tradition?\nMai: Everyone appreciates ancient stone tablets and enjoys reading ancient history.\nNam: How does it reflect the cultural identity of our people?\nMai: It highlights scholar writing desks and showcases the authentic value of bronze bell.\nNam: That is wonderful! You will definitely achieve a high grade for your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Vietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying the imperial examination halls of ancient dai viet, students discover how National Museum preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering reading ancient history requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire ancient stone tablets, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "The Imperial Examination Halls of Ancient Dai Viet represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in National Museum. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined ancient stone tablets and scholar writing desks, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in reading ancient history, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard bronze bell to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nVietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying the imperial examination halls of ancient dai viet, students discover how National Museum preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering reading ancient history requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire ancient stone tablets, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe Imperial Examination Halls of Ancient Dai Viet represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in National Museum. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined ancient stone tablets and scholar writing desks, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in reading ancient history, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard bronze bell to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Location in National Museum; Key ingredients or artistic features; How it is practiced; Why it is meaningful.",
      "sampleWritingText": "The Imperial Examination Halls of Ancient Dai Viet at National Museum is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases ancient stone tablets and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in reading ancient history, visitors discover how scholar writing desks has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding bronze bell helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
