      "audioScript": "Nam: Hi Mai! What cultural heritage or culinary topic are you reviewing for English class?\nMai: Hi Nam! I am presenting about Modern Photography and Teenage Art Clubs at school art studio.\nNam: What is the most remarkable aspect of this tradition?\nMai: Everyone appreciates creative lens angles and enjoys capturing city life.\nNam: How does it reflect the cultural identity of our people?\nMai: It highlights portrait exhibition and showcases the authentic value of camera tripod.\nNam: That is wonderful! You will definitely achieve a high grade for your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Vietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying modern photography and teenage art clubs, students discover how school art studio preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering capturing city life requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire creative lens angles, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Modern Photography and Teenage Art Clubs represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in school art studio. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined creative lens angles and portrait exhibition, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in capturing city life, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard camera tripod to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nVietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying modern photography and teenage art clubs, students discover how school art studio preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering capturing city life requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire creative lens angles, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nModern Photography and Teenage Art Clubs represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in school art studio. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined creative lens angles and portrait exhibition, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in capturing city life, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard camera tripod to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Location in school art studio; Key ingredients or artistic features; How it is practiced; Why it is meaningful.",
      "sampleWritingText": "Modern Photography and Teenage Art Clubs at school art studio is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases creative lens angles and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in capturing city life, visitors discover how portrait exhibition has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding camera tripod helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
