      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_7_ck1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Phong: Hi Lan! What cultural heritage or culinary topic are you reviewing for English class?\nLan: Hi Phong! I am presenting about Traditional Ceramic Art in Bat Trang Village at Bat Trang village.\nPhong: What is the most remarkable aspect of this tradition?\nLan: Everyone appreciates potter spinning wheel and enjoys molding ceramic vases.\nPhong: How does it reflect the cultural identity of our people?\nLan: It highlights smooth wet clay and showcases the authentic value of glazing kiln.\nPhong: That is wonderful! You will definitely achieve a high grade for your presentation.",
      "clozeText": "Vietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying traditional ceramic art in bat trang village, students discover how Bat Trang village preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering molding ceramic vases requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire potter spinning wheel, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Traditional Ceramic Art in Bat Trang Village represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Bat Trang village. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined potter spinning wheel and smooth wet clay, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in molding ceramic vases, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard glazing kiln to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nVietnamese culture is celebrated worldwide for its artistic depth and culinary excellence. When studying traditional ceramic art in bat trang village, students discover how Bat Trang village preserves authentic (23) ________. For example, mastering molding ceramic vases requires great dedication and (24) ________ from learners. Many traditional recipes and art forms are (25) ________ from what we find in western cultures. In addition, visitors can taste or admire potter spinning wheel, which reflects the rich spirit of our (26) ________. Therefore, protecting these timeless treasures guarantees a strong sense of cultural (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nTraditional Ceramic Art in Bat Trang Village represents an invaluable facet of Vietnamese cultural heritage, deeply anchored in Bat Trang village. Over many centuries, generations of craftsmen and scholars have refined potter spinning wheel and smooth wet clay, creating a national icon. Both domestic visitors and foreign tourists are captivated when participating in molding ceramic vases, praising the skill and hospitality of locals. Cultural educators actively safeguard glazing kiln to ensure ancient techniques remain vibrant in the modern era. Whether enjoying aromatic regional specialties or admiring historic architecture, learners gain profound respect for national history. By cherishing and promoting these traditions, young Vietnamese students foster international friendship and cultural preservation.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Location in Bat Trang village; Key ingredients or artistic features; How it is practiced; Why it is meaningful.",
      "sampleWritingText": "Traditional Ceramic Art in Bat Trang Village at Bat Trang village is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases potter spinning wheel and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in molding ceramic vases, visitors discover how smooth wet clay has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding glazing kiln helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
