          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) describing Banh Mi - The World-Famous Vietnamese Sandwich.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Location in local street bistro; Key ingredients or artistic features; How it is practiced; Why it is meaningful.",
