          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) describing Ethnic Bamboo Instruments and Dan T'rung Melodies.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Location in Central Highlands; Key ingredients or artistic features; How it is practiced; Why it is meaningful.",
          "options": [],
          "correct": "Ethnic Bamboo Instruments and Dan T'rung Melodies at Central Highlands is one of my favourite cultural experiences. It showcases hollow bamboo tubes and reflects the profound wisdom of our ancestors. When engaging in playing tribal tunes, visitors discover how resonant mountain echoes has been preserved across generations. Furthermore, safeguarding wooden mallets helps younger people maintain a strong cultural identity. I am very proud of this Vietnamese heritage.",
