          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about The Unique Architecture of Tay Stilt Houses in Ha Giang.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Features of Ha Giang mountains; Key customs like lofty timber stilt houses; Why sacred ancestral altar is respected; Your reflection on preserving heritage.",
