      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_8_ck1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Phong: Hi Lan! What cultural tradition or lifestyle are you discussing in English class?\nLan: Hi Phong! I am presenting about Ancestor Worship and Family Traditions during Tet at ancient northern home.\nPhong: What is the most fascinating aspect of this custom?\nLan: Anthropologists and participants are intrigued by meticulously arranged fruit trays and enjoy paying homage to ancestors.\nPhong: How does it preserve cultural heritage or improve well-being?\nLan: It reinforces fragrant burning incense and honors the spiritual value of reunion feast table.\nPhong: Wonderful! That provides an insightful perspective on cultural diversity.",
      "clozeText": "Understanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In ancient northern home, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving meticulously arranged fruit trays and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in paying homage to ancestors, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating fragrant burning incense helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing reunion feast table strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Ancestor Worship and Family Traditions during Tet exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in ancient northern home. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies meticulously arranged fruit trays and reflects fragrant burning incense, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in paying homage to ancestors maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize reunion feast table as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nUnderstanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In ancient northern home, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving meticulously arranged fruit trays and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in paying homage to ancestors, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating fragrant burning incense helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing reunion feast table strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nAncestor Worship and Family Traditions during Tet exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in ancient northern home. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies meticulously arranged fruit trays and reflects fragrant burning incense, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in paying homage to ancestors maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize reunion feast table as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of ancient northern home; Key customs like meticulously arranged fruit trays; Why reunion feast table is respected; Your reflection on preserving heritage.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Ancestor Worship and Family Traditions during Tet is an extraordinary cultural treasure. Located in ancient northern home, it embodies meticulously arranged fruit trays and illustrates how communities harmoniously interact with their environment. Practicing paying homage to ancestors instills profound moral values and preserves fragrant burning incense. Moreover, honoring reunion feast table reinforces our ancestral roots. I believe youth should actively champion the preservation of this cherished heritage.",
