          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about Nomadic Pastoral Lifestyles on the Mongolian Steppes.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Features of Mongolian grassland; Key customs like circular felt yurt tents; Why milking mare cattle is respected; Your reflection on preserving heritage.",
