          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about The Flower H'mong Vibrant Costumes in Bac Ha.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Features of Bac Ha fair market; Key customs like intricate pleated skirts; Why silver neck torcs is respected; Your reflection on preserving heritage.",
