          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about Table Manners and Meal Etiquette Across Cultures.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Features of family dining room; Key customs like respectful chopsticks etiquette; Why polite dining phrases is respected; Your reflection on preserving heritage.",
