          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about Gong Cultural Space in the Central Highlands.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Features of Gia Lai communal house; Key customs like resonant bronze gongs; Why village elder chieftain is respected; Your reflection on preserving heritage.",
