          "id": "g8_ck1_810_q37",
          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about Terraced Rice Fields of Mu Cang Chai in Golden Season.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Features of Yen Bai mountain slopes; Key customs like stepped golden rice paddies; Why wooden rice thresher is respected; Your reflection on preserving heritage.",
