      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_8_ck1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Nam: Hi Mai! What cultural tradition or lifestyle are you discussing in English class?\nMai: Hi Nam! I am presenting about Vietnamese Filial Piety and Respect for Grandparents at three-generation home.\nNam: What is the most fascinating aspect of this custom?\nMai: Anthropologists and participants are intrigued by respectful bow greetings and enjoy listening to ancestral tales.\nNam: How does it preserve cultural heritage or improve well-being?\nMai: It reinforces caring for aging grandparents and honors the spiritual value of traditional medicinal tea.\nNam: Wonderful! That provides an insightful perspective on cultural diversity.",
      "clozeText": "Understanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In three-generation home, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving respectful bow greetings and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in listening to ancestral tales, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating caring for aging grandparents helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing traditional medicinal tea strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Vietnamese Filial Piety and Respect for Grandparents exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in three-generation home. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies respectful bow greetings and reflects caring for aging grandparents, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in listening to ancestral tales maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize traditional medicinal tea as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nUnderstanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In three-generation home, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving respectful bow greetings and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in listening to ancestral tales, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating caring for aging grandparents helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing traditional medicinal tea strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nVietnamese Filial Piety and Respect for Grandparents exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in three-generation home. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies respectful bow greetings and reflects caring for aging grandparents, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in listening to ancestral tales maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize traditional medicinal tea as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of three-generation home; Key customs like respectful bow greetings; Why traditional medicinal tea is respected; Your reflection on preserving heritage.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Vietnamese Filial Piety and Respect for Grandparents is an extraordinary cultural treasure. Located in three-generation home, it embodies respectful bow greetings and illustrates how communities harmoniously interact with their environment. Practicing listening to ancestral tales instills profound moral values and preserves caring for aging grandparents. Moreover, honoring traditional medicinal tea reinforces our ancestral roots. I believe youth should actively champion the preservation of this cherished heritage.",
