          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about The Ede Matriarchal Heritage and Communal Longhouses.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Features of Dak Lak plateau; Key customs like hundred-meter wooden longhouses; Why Kpan seating bench is respected; Your reflection on preserving heritage.",
