          "correct": "In my opinion, Traditional Wedding Ceremonies in Southern Viet Nam is an extraordinary cultural treasure. Located in Mekong River delta, it embodies festive red betel areca trays and illustrates how communities harmoniously interact with their environment. Practicing offering wedding gifts instills profound moral values and preserves elaborate wedding processions. Moreover, honoring traditional silk ao dai reinforces our ancestral roots. I believe youth should actively champion the preservation of this cherished heritage.",
          "correctLetter": "",
