      "audioScript": "Nam: Hi Mai! What cultural tradition or lifestyle are you discussing in English class?\nMai: Hi Nam! I am presenting about Zero-Waste Community Lifestyles in Modern Towns at eco-friendly township.\nNam: What is the most fascinating aspect of this custom?\nMai: Anthropologists and participants are intrigued by package-free grocery stores and enjoy composting food scraps.\nNam: How does it preserve cultural heritage or improve well-being?\nMai: It reinforces glass storage containers and honors the spiritual value of community swap meet.\nNam: Wonderful! That provides an insightful perspective on cultural diversity.",
      "clozeText": "Understanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In eco-friendly township, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving package-free grocery stores and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in composting food scraps, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating glass storage containers helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing community swap meet strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Zero-Waste Community Lifestyles in Modern Towns exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in eco-friendly township. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies package-free grocery stores and reflects glass storage containers, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in composting food scraps maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize community swap meet as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nUnderstanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In eco-friendly township, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving package-free grocery stores and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in composting food scraps, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating glass storage containers helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing community swap meet strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nZero-Waste Community Lifestyles in Modern Towns exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in eco-friendly township. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies package-free grocery stores and reflects glass storage containers, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in composting food scraps maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize community swap meet as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of eco-friendly township; Key customs like package-free grocery stores; Why community swap meet is respected; Your reflection on preserving heritage.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Zero-Waste Community Lifestyles in Modern Towns is an extraordinary cultural treasure. Located in eco-friendly township, it embodies package-free grocery stores and illustrates how communities harmoniously interact with their environment. Practicing composting food scraps instills profound moral values and preserves glass storage containers. Moreover, honoring community swap meet reinforces our ancestral roots. I believe youth should actively champion the preservation of this cherished heritage.",
