          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about The Cham Pottery Tradition of Bau Truc Village.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Features of Ninh Thuan province; Key customs like hand-molded red clay pots; Why artisan pottery stamp is respected; Your reflection on preserving heritage.",
