      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_8_ck1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Phong: Hi Lan! What cultural tradition or lifestyle are you discussing in English class?\nLan: Hi Phong! I am presenting about Slow Living: Reconnecting with Nature and Solitude at mountain forest retreat.\nPhong: What is the most fascinating aspect of this custom?\nLan: Anthropologists and participants are intrigued by calm murmuring streams and enjoy walking along pine paths.\nPhong: How does it preserve cultural heritage or improve well-being?\nLan: It reinforces offline digital detox weeks and honors the spiritual value of journal notebook.\nPhong: Wonderful! That provides an insightful perspective on cultural diversity.",
      "clozeText": "Understanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In mountain forest retreat, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving calm murmuring streams and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in walking along pine paths, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating offline digital detox weeks helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing journal notebook strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Slow Living: Reconnecting with Nature and Solitude exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in mountain forest retreat. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies calm murmuring streams and reflects offline digital detox weeks, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in walking along pine paths maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize journal notebook as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nUnderstanding diverse cultural customs and modern lifestyles enriches our appreciation of human society. In mountain forest retreat, local communities take tremendous pride in preserving calm murmuring streams and ancestral (23) ________. When participating in walking along pine paths, young people cultivate respect, empathy, and social (24) ________. Although contemporary lifestyles are evolving rapidly, people (25) ________ remember their ancestral origins. Furthermore, integrating offline digital detox weeks helps teenagers lead more meaningful and (26) ________ lives. In summary, cherishing journal notebook strengthens the bond between past heritage and future (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nSlow Living: Reconnecting with Nature and Solitude exemplifies the profound richness of cultural diversity and community identity found in mountain forest retreat. Rooted in centuries of history, this custom embodies calm murmuring streams and reflects offline digital detox weeks, captivating observers worldwide. Communities who actively engage in walking along pine paths maintain strong interpersonal harmony and mutual assistance across generations. Cultural specialists emphasize journal notebook as a vital emblem that shields ancient wisdom from the pressures of globalization. Moreover, whether studying traditional ethnic practices or adopting conscious sustainable lifestyles, youths gain moral depth. By embracing ancestral heritage alongside modern progress, societies preserve their cultural soul while marching forward.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Features of mountain forest retreat; Key customs like calm murmuring streams; Why journal notebook is respected; Your reflection on preserving heritage.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Slow Living: Reconnecting with Nature and Solitude is an extraordinary cultural treasure. Located in mountain forest retreat, it embodies calm murmuring streams and illustrates how communities harmoniously interact with their environment. Practicing walking along pine paths instills profound moral values and preserves offline digital detox weeks. Moreover, honoring journal notebook reinforces our ancestral roots. I believe youth should actively champion the preservation of this cherished heritage.",
