          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about Slow Living: Reconnecting with Nature and Solitude.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Features of mountain forest retreat; Key customs like calm murmuring streams; Why journal notebook is respected; Your reflection on preserving heritage.",
