          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about The Pa Then Fire Dancing Festival in Tuyen Quang.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Features of mountainous hamlet; Key customs like crackling red-hot embers; Why spiritual village shaman is respected; Your reflection on preserving heritage.",
