          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (60-80 words) about Mid-Autumn Mooncake Baking Family Heritage.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Features of family bakery kitchen; Key customs like traditional wooden mooncake molds; Why fragrant jasmine tea is respected; Your reflection on preserving heritage.",
