          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about The Subterranean Splendor of Son Doong Cave.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Historical context in Phong Nha - Ke Bang national park; Key features like towering limestone dolines; How spelunking through colossal caverns impacted society; Importance of subterranean river crossing.",
