          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about Childhood Folk Games and Traditional Toys (O An Quan).\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Historical context in village communal courtyard; Key features like smooth river pebbles and chalk grids; How playing traditional board games impacted society; Importance of bamboo toy spinner.",
