      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Phong: Hi Lan! What historical milestone or wonder of Viet Nam are you presenting today?\nLan: Hi Phong! I am presenting about Trang An Scenic Landscape Complex Mixed UNESCO Heritage at Ninh Binh waterways.\nPhong: What is the most remarkable feature of this topic?\nLan: Historians and travelers are captivated by towering karst peaks and intrigued by rowing traditional sampans.\nPhong: How does it illustrate Viet Nam's heritage or rapid modernization?\nLan: It highlights mysterious submerged water caverns and demonstrates the enduring value of ancient floating temple.\nPhong: Outstanding! Your talk provides deep historical depth and national pride.",
      "clozeText": "Reflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In Ninh Binh waterways, historians and architects have meticulously studied towering karst peaks to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in rowing traditional sampans, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving ancient floating temple guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Trang An Scenic Landscape Complex Mixed UNESCO Heritage serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with Ninh Binh waterways. Throughout decades of change, towering karst peaks and mysterious submerged water caverns have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in rowing traditional sampans gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect ancient floating temple to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nReflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In Ninh Binh waterways, historians and architects have meticulously studied towering karst peaks to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in rowing traditional sampans, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving ancient floating temple guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nTrang An Scenic Landscape Complex Mixed UNESCO Heritage serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with Ninh Binh waterways. Throughout decades of change, towering karst peaks and mysterious submerged water caverns have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in rowing traditional sampans gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect ancient floating temple to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Historical context in Ninh Binh waterways; Key features like towering karst peaks; How rowing traditional sampans impacted society; Importance of ancient floating temple.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Trang An Scenic Landscape Complex Mixed UNESCO Heritage offers a profound window into our nation's history. Located in Ninh Binh waterways, it commemorates towering karst peaks and reflects the incredible resilience of previous generations. Reflecting on rowing traditional sampans helps modern teenagers appreciate contemporary privileges while honoring mysterious submerged water caverns. Furthermore, safeguarding ancient floating temple preserves our sacred national soul amidst rapid globalization. I am immensely proud of Viet Nam's historical legacy.",
