      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Nam: Hi Mai! What historical milestone or wonder of Viet Nam are you presenting today?\nMai: Hi Nam! I am presenting about Education in Rural Viet Nam: Past Hardships and Triumphs at highland ethnic boarding school.\nNam: What is the most remarkable feature of this topic?\nMai: Historians and travelers are captivated by solar-powered computer labs and intrigued by studying advanced sciences.\nNam: How does it illustrate Viet Nam's heritage or rapid modernization?\nMai: It highlights bilingual digital textbooks and demonstrates the enduring value of dedicated volunteer teacher.\nNam: Outstanding! Your talk provides deep historical depth and national pride.",
      "clozeText": "Reflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In highland ethnic boarding school, historians and architects have meticulously studied solar-powered computer labs to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in studying advanced sciences, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving dedicated volunteer teacher guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Education in Rural Viet Nam: Past Hardships and Triumphs serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with highland ethnic boarding school. Throughout decades of change, solar-powered computer labs and bilingual digital textbooks have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in studying advanced sciences gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect dedicated volunteer teacher to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nReflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In highland ethnic boarding school, historians and architects have meticulously studied solar-powered computer labs to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in studying advanced sciences, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving dedicated volunteer teacher guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nEducation in Rural Viet Nam: Past Hardships and Triumphs serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with highland ethnic boarding school. Throughout decades of change, solar-powered computer labs and bilingual digital textbooks have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in studying advanced sciences gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect dedicated volunteer teacher to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Historical context in highland ethnic boarding school; Key features like solar-powered computer labs; How studying advanced sciences impacted society; Importance of dedicated volunteer teacher.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Education in Rural Viet Nam: Past Hardships and Triumphs offers a profound window into our nation's history. Located in highland ethnic boarding school, it commemorates solar-powered computer labs and reflects the incredible resilience of previous generations. Reflecting on studying advanced sciences helps modern teenagers appreciate contemporary privileges while honoring bilingual digital textbooks. Furthermore, safeguarding dedicated volunteer teacher preserves our sacred national soul amidst rapid globalization. I am immensely proud of Viet Nam's historical legacy.",
