          "id": "g9_ck1_910_q37",
          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about Extended Three-Generation Families Living Together.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Historical context in traditional urban townhouse; Key features like sharing multigenerational stories; How eating dinner together impacted society; Importance of ancestral wooden altar.",
          "options": [],
