          "qNumber": 37,
          "id": "g9_ck1_912_q37",
          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about Vietnamese Telecommunications from Telegrams to 5G.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Historical context in telecom innovation center; Key features like high-speed optical fiber backbones; How connecting rural communities impacted society; Importance of satellite earth station.",
