      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Phong: Hi Lan! What historical milestone or wonder of Viet Nam are you presenting today?\nLan: Hi Phong! I am presenting about Conquering the Majestic Karst Peaks of Ha Giang Plateau at Dong Van rocky plateau.\nPhong: What is the most remarkable feature of this topic?\nLan: Historians and travelers are captivated by winding Ma Pi Leng mountain pass and intrigued by motorcycling scenic passes.\nPhong: How does it illustrate Viet Nam's heritage or rapid modernization?\nLan: It highlights emerald Nho Que river canyon and demonstrates the enduring value of steep stone cliffs.\nPhong: Outstanding! Your talk provides deep historical depth and national pride.",
      "clozeText": "Reflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In Dong Van rocky plateau, historians and architects have meticulously studied winding Ma Pi Leng mountain pass to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in motorcycling scenic passes, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving steep stone cliffs guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Conquering the Majestic Karst Peaks of Ha Giang Plateau serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with Dong Van rocky plateau. Throughout decades of change, winding Ma Pi Leng mountain pass and emerald Nho Que river canyon have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in motorcycling scenic passes gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect steep stone cliffs to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nReflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In Dong Van rocky plateau, historians and architects have meticulously studied winding Ma Pi Leng mountain pass to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in motorcycling scenic passes, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving steep stone cliffs guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nConquering the Majestic Karst Peaks of Ha Giang Plateau serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with Dong Van rocky plateau. Throughout decades of change, winding Ma Pi Leng mountain pass and emerald Nho Que river canyon have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in motorcycling scenic passes gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect steep stone cliffs to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Historical context in Dong Van rocky plateau; Key features like winding Ma Pi Leng mountain pass; How motorcycling scenic passes impacted society; Importance of steep stone cliffs.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Conquering the Majestic Karst Peaks of Ha Giang Plateau offers a profound window into our nation's history. Located in Dong Van rocky plateau, it commemorates winding Ma Pi Leng mountain pass and reflects the incredible resilience of previous generations. Reflecting on motorcycling scenic passes helps modern teenagers appreciate contemporary privileges while honoring emerald Nho Que river canyon. Furthermore, safeguarding steep stone cliffs preserves our sacred national soul amidst rapid globalization. I am immensely proud of Viet Nam's historical legacy.",
