          "id": "g9_ck1_916_q37",
          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about The Historic Long Bien Bridge Over the Red River.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Historical context in Red River crossing; Key features like riveted steel cantilever spans; How watching river barges pass impacted society; Importance of century-old railway track.",
