          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about Ba Be Freshwater Mountain Lake Biosphere.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Historical context in Bac Kan national park; Key features like pristine mountain lake waters; How canoeing through calm bays impacted society; Importance of Tay ethnic wooden stilt house.",
