      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Phong: Hi Lan! What historical milestone or wonder of Viet Nam are you presenting today?\nLan: Hi Phong! I am presenting about The Rise of High-Tech Agriculture in Da Lat Highlands at greenhouse agricultural valley.\nPhong: What is the most remarkable feature of this topic?\nLan: Historians and travelers are captivated by automated drip nutrient irrigation and intrigued by harvesting organic vegetables.\nPhong: How does it illustrate Viet Nam's heritage or rapid modernization?\nLan: It highlights export-grade strawberries and orchids and demonstrates the enduring value of smart climate greenhouse.\nPhong: Outstanding! Your talk provides deep historical depth and national pride.",
      "clozeText": "Reflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In greenhouse agricultural valley, historians and architects have meticulously studied automated drip nutrient irrigation to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in harvesting organic vegetables, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving smart climate greenhouse guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "The Rise of High-Tech Agriculture in Da Lat Highlands serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with greenhouse agricultural valley. Throughout decades of change, automated drip nutrient irrigation and export-grade strawberries and orchids have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in harvesting organic vegetables gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect smart climate greenhouse to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nReflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In greenhouse agricultural valley, historians and architects have meticulously studied automated drip nutrient irrigation to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in harvesting organic vegetables, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving smart climate greenhouse guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nThe Rise of High-Tech Agriculture in Da Lat Highlands serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with greenhouse agricultural valley. Throughout decades of change, automated drip nutrient irrigation and export-grade strawberries and orchids have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in harvesting organic vegetables gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect smart climate greenhouse to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Historical context in greenhouse agricultural valley; Key features like automated drip nutrient irrigation; How harvesting organic vegetables impacted society; Importance of smart climate greenhouse.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, The Rise of High-Tech Agriculture in Da Lat Highlands offers a profound window into our nation's history. Located in greenhouse agricultural valley, it commemorates automated drip nutrient irrigation and reflects the incredible resilience of previous generations. Reflecting on harvesting organic vegetables helps modern teenagers appreciate contemporary privileges while honoring export-grade strawberries and orchids. Furthermore, safeguarding smart climate greenhouse preserves our sacred national soul amidst rapid globalization. I am immensely proud of Viet Nam's historical legacy.",
