          "qNumber": 37,
          "id": "g9_ck1_918_q37",
          "type": "essay",
          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about The Rise of High-Tech Agriculture in Da Lat Highlands.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Historical context in greenhouse agricultural valley; Key features like automated drip nutrient irrigation; How harvesting organic vegetables impacted society; Importance of smart climate greenhouse.",
          "options": [],
          "correct": "In my opinion, The Rise of High-Tech Agriculture in Da Lat Highlands offers a profound window into our nation's history. Located in greenhouse agricultural valley, it commemorates automated drip nutrient irrigation and reflects the incredible resilience of previous generations. Reflecting on harvesting organic vegetables helps modern teenagers appreciate contemporary privileges while honoring export-grade strawberries and orchids. Furthermore, safeguarding smart climate greenhouse preserves our sacred national soul amidst rapid globalization. I am immensely proud of Viet Nam's historical legacy.",
