          "text": "Write a paragraph (80-100 words) about Reviving Traditional Lacquerware Art in Duyen Thai Village.\n\nGợi ý chi tiết:\nMention: Historical context in lacquerware artisan workshop; Key features like lustrous layers of natural sap; How polishing delicate lacquer trays impacted society; Importance of master artisan craftsman.",
