      "teacherName": "Thầy Đinh Văn Thành",
      "audioUrl": "/web-tieng-anh/audio/listening_9_ck1.mp3",
      "audioScript": "Phong: Hi Lan! What historical milestone or wonder of Viet Nam are you presenting today?\nLan: Hi Phong! I am presenting about Infrastructure Modernization: Expressways Across Viet Nam at national expressway network.\nPhong: What is the most remarkable feature of this topic?\nLan: Historians and travelers are captivated by smooth multi-lane asphalt highways and intrigued by traveling intercity routes.\nPhong: How does it illustrate Viet Nam's heritage or rapid modernization?\nLan: It highlights electronic toll collection (ETC) and demonstrates the enduring value of highway traffic control center.\nPhong: Outstanding! Your talk provides deep historical depth and national pride.",
      "clozeText": "Reflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In national expressway network, historians and architects have meticulously studied smooth multi-lane asphalt highways to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in traveling intercity routes, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving highway traffic control center guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.",
      "readingText": "Infrastructure Modernization: Expressways Across Viet Nam serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with national expressway network. Throughout decades of change, smooth multi-lane asphalt highways and electronic toll collection (ETC) have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in traveling intercity routes gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect highway traffic control center to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "passageText": "📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐIỀN TỪ (CLOZE TEXT):\nReflecting on the past and appreciating our national wonders allows teenagers to grasp how far society has progressed. In national expressway network, historians and architects have meticulously studied smooth multi-lane asphalt highways to document our cultural (23) ________. Over recent decades, Viet Nam has transformed from a war-torn agricultural land into a dynamic (24) ________. Older generations often remember when people (25) ________ rely on rudimentary tools and public tramways. By participating in traveling intercity routes, youths develop a profound respect for their ancestors' resilience and (26) ________. In conclusion, preserving highway traffic control center guarantees that progress remains rooted in our timeless national (27) ________.\n\n📖 ĐOẠN VĂN ĐỌC HIỂU (READING PASSAGE):\nInfrastructure Modernization: Expressways Across Viet Nam serves as an eloquent testament to the rich historical journey and natural magnificence associated with national expressway network. Throughout decades of change, smooth multi-lane asphalt highways and electronic toll collection (ETC) have stood as powerful symbols of Vietnamese perseverance and artistic mastery. Scholars and travelers who engage in traveling intercity routes gain intimate knowledge of how socio-economic shifts have reshaped daily existence. Preservationists and urban planners actively protect highway traffic control center to strike a balance between modernization and historical integrity. Whether exploring colossal karst caverns or examining twentieth-century communal traditions, learners cultivate patriotic pride. Understanding these triumphs and memories empowers ninth graders to become enlightened, forward-looking global citizens.",
      "writingRubric": "Tiêu chí chấm điểm (1.0đ): Mention: Historical context in national expressway network; Key features like smooth multi-lane asphalt highways; How traveling intercity routes impacted society; Importance of highway traffic control center.",
      "sampleWritingText": "In my opinion, Infrastructure Modernization: Expressways Across Viet Nam offers a profound window into our nation's history. Located in national expressway network, it commemorates smooth multi-lane asphalt highways and reflects the incredible resilience of previous generations. Reflecting on traveling intercity routes helps modern teenagers appreciate contemporary privileges while honoring electronic toll collection (ETC). Furthermore, safeguarding highway traffic control center preserves our sacred national soul amidst rapid globalization. I am immensely proud of Viet Nam's historical legacy.",
